  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COOPAI Onion Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion production and marketing, Beneficiaries: 315 (92 women), Description: The Cooperative will diversify their agro-production by cultivating onions to be sold on the local and neighboring markets. The funding from USADF will provide the cooperative with access to sufficient quantities of quality seeds, improved conservation and storage facilities, and technical assistance and training, as well as improve the financial and administrative management capacity of the Cooperative.</narrative>
  </description>
